Package: jlis
Type: Package
Title: Joint Low-Rank and Individual Sparse Matrix Regression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("JLIS software project", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "package@example.invalid")
Description: Fits multigroup Gaussian and binomial matrix regression models
    with a shared low-rank component and group-specific sparse components.
    Provides entrywise-constrained estimation, simulation experiments,
    archived numerical results, and coefficient-error plots.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils, parallel, pracma
Suggests: ggplot2, glmnet, foreach, doParallel, iterators, MASS
